OL,5,G0000 Sean Connery Vs James Bond
OL,6,     FExplore the eclectic career of
OL,7,     FSean Connery, who, having become a
OL,8,     Fstar thanks to James Bond, never
OL,9,     Fstopped trying to shed the image
OL,10,     Fof a sexy, brutal macho that stuck
OL,11,     Fto 007.
